From 154c6baadc072910ef7d59076f83bc867e42a292 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FunnyAWM <1142978300@qq.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 17:49:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop): tie the local gateway lifetime to the desktop
 app

The app now stays resident in the tray by default, so closing the
window keeps the gateway and live work running. A real quit stops the
local gateway owner before exit, and the quit prompt now warns that
local work is lost. Remote and cloud backends keep running.
